      text: "\uB808\uB4DC\uBA3C\uB4DC UFO \uC18D\uBCF4"
      status: final
  - id: intro_pizza_card
    sectionId: intro_bridge
    order: 10
    enabled: 1
    type: caption
    status: placeholder
    runtimeCue: 
    triggerEvent: encounter.opening.card.1
    condition: first play and placeholder montage enabled
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: 
    speakerLocalizationKey: 
    speakerFallback: 
    localizationKey: first_contact.placeholder.intro.pizza
    sourceText: ZAUCER PIZZA
    advance: automatic-or-player
    minimumSeconds: 0.9
    situation: The presidential party reaches the restaurant hiding the facility
      entrance.
    beforeAction: The news card closes.
    afterAction: Advance to the classified elevator card.
    stageDirection: Geometric pizza sign and concealed doorway.
    tags:
    - intro
    - placeholder
    - caption
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "Zaucer \uD53C\uC790 \uBE44\uBC00 \uC785\uAD6C"
      status: final
  - id: intro_elevator_card
    sectionId: intro_bridge
    order: 20
    enabled: 1
    type: caption
    status: placeholder
    runtimeCue: 
    triggerEvent: encounter.opening.card.2
    condition: first play and placeholder montage enabled
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: 
    speakerLocalizationKey: 
    speakerFallback: 
    localizationKey: first_contact.placeholder.intro.elevator
    sourceText: CLASSIFIED ELEVATOR
    advance: automatic-or-player
    minimumSeconds: 0.9
    situation: The hidden elevator descends to the underground facility.
    beforeAction: The restaurant storeroom opens.
    afterAction: Advance to the translator briefing card.
    stageDirection: Sealed industrial elevator descending.
    tags:
    - intro
    - placeholder
    - caption
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF9\uBE44 \uC9C0\uD558 \uC5D8\uB9AC\uBCA0\uC774\uD130"
      status: final
  - id: intro_briefing_card
    sectionId: intro_bridge
    order: 30
    enabled: 1
    type: caption
    status: placeholder
    runtimeCue: 
    triggerEvent: encounter.opening.card.3
    condition: first play and placeholder montage enabled
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: 
    speakerLocalizationKey: 
    speakerFallback: 
    localizationKey: first_contact.placeholder.intro.briefing
    sourceText: TRANSLATOR BRIEFING
    advance: automatic-or-player
    minimumSeconds: 0.9
    situation: Dr. Hwang finishes the briefing immediately before gameplay.
    beforeAction: The party enters the underground briefing room.
    afterAction: Cut to the live meeting room and begin the tablet preflight.
    stageDirection: Projector silhouette and translator diagram.
    tags:
    - intro
    - placeholder
    - caption
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC678\uACC4\uC5B4 \uBC88\uC5ED\uAE30 \uBE0C\uB9AC\uD551"
      status: final
  - id: preflight_intro
    sectionId: preflight
    order: 0
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: PreflightIntro
    triggerEvent: preflight.started
    condition: first play and preflight enabled
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    localizationKey: first_contact.narrative.preflight_intro
    sourceText: 'Before they arrive, I need to see whether you can produce a usable
      visual probe. '
    advance: player
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    situation: The delegation is still outside while Dr. Hwang begins a local equipment
      check.
    beforeAction: The briefing ends and the tablet comes into view.
    afterAction: The drawing tools illuminate.
    stageDirection: Keep the tablet and its physical controls in frame.
    tags:
    - onboarding
    - preflight
    - tablet
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB370\uC774\uD130 \uC218\uC9D1\uC744 \uC2DC\uC791\uD558\uAE30 \uC804\uC5D0
        \uC800\uB791 \uBA3C\uC800 \uC5F0\uC2B5\uC744 \uD574\uBCF4\uC2DC\uC8E0 \uAC01\uD558. "
      status: final
  - id: tablet_tools
    sectionId: preflight
    order: 10
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: TabletTools
    triggerEvent: preflight.controls.tools
    condition: first play and preflight enabled
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    localizationKey: first_contact.narrative.tablet_tools
    sourceText: The three illuminated controls are the brush, fill, and eraser.
    advance: player
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    situation: The brush, fill, and eraser controls pulse together.
    beforeAction: The local preflight channel is shown on the terminal.
    afterAction: The line-width and color controls illuminate.
    stageDirection: Pulse only the three tool controls.
    tags:
    - onboarding
    - preflight
    - controls
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC9C0\uAE08 \uC810\uB4F1\uB41C \uC138 \uBC84\uD2BC\uC740 \uD39C, \uCC44\uC6B0\uAE30,
        \uC9C0\uC6B0\uAC1C\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      status: final
  - id: tablet_style
    sectionId: preflight
    order: 20
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: TabletStyle
    triggerEvent: preflight.controls.style
    condition: first play and preflight enabled
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    localizationKey: first_contact.narrative.tablet_style
    sourceText: These buttons change line width. Use the slider beside them to choose
      a color.
    advance: player
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    situation: The line-width buttons and color spectrum pulse together.
    beforeAction: Dr. Hwang finishes identifying the tools.
    afterAction: The history and clear controls illuminate.
    stageDirection: Pulse the size buttons, spectrum, and color knob.
    tags:
    - onboarding
    - preflight
    - controls
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774 \uBC84\uD2BC\uB4E4\uC740 \uC120 \uAD75\uAE30\uB97C \uBC14\uAFB8\uACE0,
        \uC606\uC758 \uC2AC\uB77C\uC774\uB354\uB85C \uC0C9\uC744 \uACE0\uB97C \uC218
        \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      status: final
  - id: tablet_history_and_send
    sectionId: preflight
    order: 30
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: TabletHistoryAndSend
    triggerEvent: preflight.controls.history_and_send
    condition: first play and preflight enabled
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    localizationKey: first_contact.narrative.tablet_history_and_send
    sourceText: Use these to undo, redo, or clear the canvas. When the drawing is
      ready, press Enter.
    advance: player
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    situation: The undo, redo, and clear controls pulse together.
    beforeAction: Dr. Hwang finishes identifying the style controls.
    afterAction: All tutorial highlights turn off and the canvas unlocks.
    stageDirection: Pulse the undo, redo, and clear controls.
    tags:
    - onboarding
    - preflight
    - controls
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774\uCABD\uC740 \uC21C\uC11C\uB300\uB85C \uC804\uCCB4 \uC0AD\uC81C,
        \uC2E4\uD589 \uCDE8\uC18C, \uB2E4\uC2DC \uC2E4\uD589\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      status: final
  - id: preflight_drawing
    sectionId: preflight
    order: 40
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: PreflightDrawing
    triggerEvent: preflight.canvas.unlocked
    condition: first play and preflight enabled
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    localizationKey: first_contact.narrative.preflight_drawing
    sourceText: Draw one concrete object. No words, symbols, scenes, or extra objects.
    advance: player
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    situation: The drawing surface is unlocked for the practice probe.
    beforeAction: The control walkthrough finishes.
    afterAction: The player draws and submits a local practice probe.
    stageDirection: Leave the tablet unobstructed after the subtitle closes.
    tags:
    - onboarding
    - preflight
    - drawing
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0AC\uBB3C\uC744 \uC544\uBB34\uAC70\uB098 \uB531 \uD558\uB098\uB9CC
        \uADF8\uB824\uC8FC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624.\n\uAE00\uC790\uB098 \uAE30\uD638, \uBCF5\uC7A1\uD55C
        \uC7A5\uBA74\uC740 \uC548 \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n\uC0C9\uAE54\uB3C4 \uC0AC\uC6A9\uD574\uC11C
        \uADF8\uB824 \uC8FC\uC2DC\uBA74 \uC54C\uC544\uBCF4\uAE30\uAC00 \uC27D\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      status: final
  - id: preflight_passed
    sectionId: preflight
    order: 50
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: PreflightPassed
    triggerEvent: preflight.completed
    condition: practice probe passed or local analysis was overridden
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    localizationKey: first_contact.narrative.preflight_passed
    sourceText: Good enough. We have seen what we need; the practice sample will
      not be recorded.
    advance: player
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    situation: The practice probe has cleared the local validation path without opening
      the alien response channel.
    beforeAction: The preflight result appears on the terminal.
    afterAction: The alien delegation enters and the real calibration round begins.
    stageDirection: Hold on the preflight result, then cut to the delegation entrance.
    tags:
    - onboarding
    - preflight
    - completion
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC88B\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC0DD\uAC01\uBCF4\uB2E4 \uAF64 \uC798 \uADF8\uB9AC\uC2DC\uB294\uAD70\uC694,
        \uAC01\uD558."
      status: final
  - id: delegation_arrival
    sectionId: arrival
    order: 0
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: DelegationArrival
    triggerEvent: encounter.opening.delegation_seated
    condition: first play
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    localizationKey: first_contact.narrative.delegation_arrival
    sourceText: The delegation is in position. The terminal will record their response.
    advance: automatic
    minimumSeconds: 1.2
    situation: The suited aliens have taken their seats across the table.
    beforeAction: Camera finishes the delegation entrance.
    afterAction: Control returns and the terminal becomes the next obvious focus.
    stageDirection: Dr. Hwang speaks from beside the analysis terminal.
    tags:
    - onboarding
    - arrival
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC678\uACC4\uC778 \uB300\uD45C\uB2E8\uC774 \uC790\uB9AC\uC5D0 \uC549\uC558\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC774\uC81C \uD130\uBBF8\uB110\uB85C \uC800\uB4E4\uC758 \uBC18\uC751\uC744
        \uAE30\uB85D\uD558\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      status: final
  - id: first_category
    sectionId: bootstrap
    order: 0
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: FirstCategory
    triggerEvent: terminal.category.opened
    condition: first category with zero traces
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    localizationKey: first_contact.narrative.first_category
    sourceText: We will begin with {category}. Select the terminal when you are ready.
    advance: player
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    situation: The player has selected a calibration category for the first time.
    beforeAction: A category channel is opened on the terminal.
    afterAction: The player opens the drawing surface.
    stageDirection: Keep the terminal visible behind the subtitle.
    tags:
    - onboarding
    - category
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC6B0\uC120 {category} \uCE74\uD14C\uACE0\uB9AC \uB370\uC774\uD130\uBD80\uD130
        \uC218\uC9D1\uD558\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC900\uBE44\uB418\uBA74 \uD130\uBBF8\uB110\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uC5D4\uD130\uB97C \uB20C\uB7EC \uC2DC\uC791\uD574 \uC8FC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
      status: final
  - id: first_drawing
    sectionId: bootstrap
    order: 10
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: FirstDrawing
    triggerEvent: drawing.surface.opened
    condition: first drawing opened
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    localizationKey: first_contact.narrative.first_drawing
    sourceText: Draw one concrete object in the {category} category. One object only.
    advance: player
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    situation: The drawing tablet is ready for the first sample.
    beforeAction: The player opens the sample channel.
    afterAction: The player draws a single object.
    stageDirection: Do not cover the active canvas.
    tags:
    - onboarding
    - drawing
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uAC01\uD558\uAC00 {category}\uC5D0 \uD574\uB2F9\uD55C\uB2E4\uACE0 \uC0DD\uAC01\uD558\uC2DC\uB294
        \uAD6C\uCCB4\uC801\uC778 \uC0AC\uBB3C \uD558\uB098\uB97C \uADF8\uB9AC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624.
        \uD558\uB098\uB9CC\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      status: final
  - id: first_label
    sectionId: bootstrap
    order: 20
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: FirstLabel
    triggerEvent: sample.label.opened
    condition: first label input opened
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    localizationKey: first_contact.narrative.first_label
    sourceText: Enter the name of the object. The machine needs the label to compare
      the signal.
    advance: player
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    situation: A drawing exists but the system still needs its human label.
    beforeAction: The player confirms the drawing.
    afterAction: The player labels and transmits the sample.
    stageDirection: Focus remains on the terminal label field.
    tags:
    - onboarding
    - label
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB9B0 \uC0AC\uBB3C\uC758 \uC774\uB984\uC744 \uC785\uB825\uD558\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624.
        \uC2E0\uD638\uB97C \uBE44\uAD50\uD558\uB824\uBA74 \uD45C\uBCF8 \uB77C\uBCA8\uC774
        \uD544\uC694\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      status: final
  - id: first_trace
    sectionId: bootstrap
    order: 30
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: FirstTrace
    triggerEvent: terminal.trace.accepted
    condition: first accepted trace
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    localizationKey: first_contact.narrative.first_trace
    sourceText: One response trace recorded. Different objects in the same category
      should form a group.
    advance: player
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    situation: The first useful alien response trace has appeared.
    beforeAction: The aliens react to the transmitted sample.
    afterAction: The player prepares another distinct sample in the same category.
    stageDirection: Camera has returned to the terminal trace display.
    tags:
    - onboarding
    - trace
    - group
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBC18\uC751 \uC2E0\uD638 \uD558\uB098\uAC00 \uAE30\uB85D\uB410\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uAC19\uC740 \uBD84\uB958\uC758 \uB2E4\uB978 \uC0AC\uBB3C\uB4E4\uC744 \uBCF4\uB0B4\uBA74
        \uBE44\uC2B7\uD55C \uC2E0\uD638\uB07C\uB9AC \uBC18\uC751 \uD328\uD134\uC744
        \uAD00\uCC30\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uC744 \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      status: final
  - id: more_samples
    sectionId: bootstrap
    order: 40
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: MoreSamples
    triggerEvent: terminal.trace.accepted
    condition: second accepted trace
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    localizationKey: first_contact.narrative.more_samples
    sourceText: Good. We need {remaining} more different sample to stabilize the
      group.
    advance: automatic
    minimumSeconds: 1.2
    situation: A response group is forming but is not stable yet.
    beforeAction: A second distinct sample is accepted.
    afterAction: The player submits the remaining sample.
    stageDirection: Short confirmation over the terminal.
    tags:
    - onboarding
    - trace
    - group
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC88B\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB2E4\uB978 \uD45C\uBCF8 {remaining}\uAC1C\uB9CC
        \uB354 \uC788\uC73C\uBA74 \uBC18\uC751 \uD328\uD134\uC744 \uD2B9\uC815\uD574\uB0BC
        \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      status: final
  - id: category_calibrated
    sectionId: bootstrap
    order: 50
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: CategoryCalibrated
    triggerEvent: terminal.group.stable
    condition: required traces accepted for current category
    repeat: once-per-category
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    localizationKey: first_contact.narrative.category_calibrated
    sourceText: The {category} response group is stable. Calibration is complete.
    advance: automatic
    minimumSeconds: 1.2
    situation: The category display has reached 03/03 and GROUP is stable.
    beforeAction: The aliens give a positive group reaction.
    afterAction: The player selects another uncalibrated category.
    stageDirection: Return from the alien reaction shot to the terminal before the
      line.
    tags:
    - calibration
    - group
    - milestone
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "{category} \uBC18\uC751 \uD328\uD134\uC744 \uD2B9\uC815 \uD588\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC774\uC81C {category} \uCE74\uD14C\uACE0\uB9AC\uC5D0 \uD574\uB2F9\uD558\uB294
        \uB2E8\uC5B4\uB294 \uBC88\uC5ED\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uACA0\uB124\uC694."
      status: final
  - id: bootstrap_calibrated
    sectionId: translation_proof
    order: 0
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: BootstrapCalibrated
    triggerEvent: terminal.bootstrap.complete
    condition: all bootstrap categories calibrated
    repeat: once-per-session
    speakerId: doctor_hwang
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    localizationKey: first_contact.narrative.bootstrap_calibrated
    sourceText: All {count} categories are calibrated. Let us see whether it can
      translate a new signal.
    advance: player
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    situation: Every bootstrap category is stable and the translator can be tested.
    beforeAction: The final category completes calibration.
    afterAction: An unsolicited alien signal arrives.
    stageDirection: Hold on the terminal before cutting to the aliens.
    tags:
    - translation
    - milestone
    localizedTexts:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uCD1D {count}\uAC1C \uBD84\uB958\uC758 \uBCF4\uC815\uC774 \uB05D\uB0AC\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC774\uC81C \uCC98\uC74C \uB4E3\uB294 \uC2E0\uD638\uB3C4 \uBC88\uC5ED\uD558\uB294\uC9C0
        \uD655\uC778\uD574 \uBCF4\uC8E0."
      status: final
  - id: translation_succeeded
    sectionId: translation_proof
    order: 10
    enabled: 1
    type: dialogue
    status: final
    runtimeCue: TranslationSucceeded
